Subject: [PATCH] 同步移动界面修复与产品版本

---
 chrome/browser/resources/aegis_agent/agent.css     | 30 ++++++++++++++++++++--
 .../resources/aegis_agent/mobile_settings.ts       | 11 ++++++++
 chrome/browser/ui/webui/help/aegis_github_update.h |  4 +--
 .../aegis_downloads/aegis_download_panel.css       | 22 ++++++++++++++--
